%% TiDB Distributed Transaction Flow (2PC)
%% Analysis Commit: bd6aa865308ed409fd7010af83a84249bf398d8c

sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant TiDB
    participant PD
    participant TiKV1 as TiKV-1<br/>(Primary Key)
    participant TiKV2 as TiKV-2<br/>(Secondary Key)

    Note over Client,TiKV2: Optimistic Transaction Example

    Client->>TiDB: BEGIN
    TiDB->>PD: Get Timestamp
    PD-->>TiDB: start_ts = 100
    TiDB-->>Client: OK

    Client->>TiDB: UPDATE users SET balance=500 WHERE id=1
    Note over TiDB: Buffer write in memory
    TiDB-->>Client: OK (not committed yet)

    Client->>TiDB: INSERT INTO orders VALUES (...)
    Note over TiDB: Buffer another write
    TiDB-->>Client: OK

    Client->>TiDB: COMMIT

    rect rgb(255, 240, 220)
        Note over TiDB,TiKV2: Phase 1: Prewrite

        TiDB->>TiKV1: Prewrite(primary_key, start_ts=100)
        TiKV1->>TiKV1: Check for conflicts
        TiKV1->>TiKV1: Write lock + intent
        TiKV1-->>TiDB: OK

        TiDB->>TiKV2: Prewrite(secondary_key, primary=key1)
        TiKV2->>TiKV2: Check for conflicts
        TiKV2->>TiKV2: Write lock + intent
        TiKV2-->>TiDB: OK
    end

    TiDB->>PD: Get Commit Timestamp
    PD-->>TiDB: commit_ts = 105

    rect rgb(220, 255, 220)
        Note over TiDB,TiKV2: Phase 2: Commit

        TiDB->>TiKV1: Commit(primary_key, commit_ts=105)
        TiKV1->>TiKV1: Write commit record
        TiKV1->>TiKV1: Remove lock
        TiKV1-->>TiDB: OK

        Note over TiDB: Commit point reached!<br/>Transaction durable
    end

    TiDB-->>Client: COMMIT SUCCESS

    Note over TiDB,TiKV2: Async: Clean up secondary keys
    TiDB->>TiKV2: Commit(secondary_key, commit_ts=105)
    TiKV2->>TiKV2: Remove lock
    TiKV2-->>TiDB: OK

    Note over Client,TiKV2: Conflict Scenario

    Client->>TiDB: BEGIN
    TiDB->>PD: start_ts = 200
    Client->>TiDB: UPDATE users SET balance=300 WHERE id=1
    Client->>TiDB: COMMIT

    TiDB->>TiKV1: Prewrite(key1, start_ts=200)
    TiKV1->>TiKV1: Detect conflict!<br/>(another txn wrote at ts=150)
    TiKV1-->>TiDB: WriteConflict Error
    TiDB->>TiDB: Rollback transaction
    TiDB-->>Client: Error: Write Conflict<br/>(Retry transaction)
